<title>POLAND: WOLCZANKA 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 5.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>WOLCZANKA 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 5.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.13 vs   0.59</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.90 vs   0.13</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.66 vs   0.34 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    8.83 vs   7.22</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.62 vs   6.48</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 9.00 vs  10.96</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.78 vs   7.09</p>
<p> Sales		   87.90 vs  77.60</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Wolczanka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
